#: {{ux|ru|[[не|Не]] '''пройдёт''' [[и]] [[полго́да]].|Not even half a year will pass.}}
# to [[be]] [[over]]
# ''(meeting, gathering)'' to [[go off]], to be [[held]]
# to [[study]], to [[cover]] (in a course)

